## 10. Running locally

```powershell
.\start-demo.ps1                 # demo mode, port 8080
.\start-demo.ps1 -Mode prod      # real backend (requires API_URL)
```

The script starts `python -m http.server <Port>` if nothing is already serving `index.html`. It then opens `index.html`, `ceremony.html`, and `admin/index.html` in Chrome, with `?mode=` set. Any static server works too, for example `npx serve .`.

