## Hardening update

### Apps Script files
Paste **all** of `apps-script/*.gs` into the project (Code.gs, Pure.gs, Live.gs, Health.gs). They share one global scope. Then run `setup` again.

### Script Properties
| Key | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `ADMIN_PASSCODE` | Owner passcode |
| `GITHUB_TOKEN` | Fine-grained PAT (this repo, Contents read/write) used to publish `live.json` |
| `GITHUB_REPO` | `owner/repo` |
| `GITHUB_BRANCH` / `GITHUB_PATH` | Optional (default `main` / `live.json`) |

### New settings
`points.checkIn`, `points.onTime`, `feature.elderMode`, `app.helpPhone`, `media.largeAlbumUrl`.

### Live feed
Admin/public writes -> `publishLive_()` (throttled to 60 s, plus a 5-minute trigger) -> GitHub `live.json` -> phones poll every 20 s (`App.liveFeed`). If the file is unavailable, phones fall back to `getLive`. The service worker never caches `live.json`.

### Concurrency and cache
Public writes listed in `PUBLIC_WRITE_ACTIONS` run in `withLock_`. `getGuest` and `getPass` responses are cached per guest version and invalidated on writes. The cache TTL is capped at the next event unlock.

### New actions
`admin.memoryBook` provides approved memories, the profile, and diyas for the printable book. Public uploads auto-route to an event by capture time (`eventForTime_`).

### Monitoring
The hourly `healthCheck` trigger checks mail quota, recent errors, the Drive folder, and `live.json`, then emails the owner. See `docs/DAY_OF.md`.

### Tests
- `cd tests; npm run backend`: Node unit tests for `Pure.gs`, demo/prod parity, and secret scan.
- `cd tests; npm test`: Playwright, including `e2e/features.spec.js`.
- `tests/Run-Tests.ps1`: static wiring checks.
- `node tests/load/load-test.js <API_URL> 50`: load rehearsal.

